 ],
 "text": "As of 15 November 2026, 23 general-seat members are listed. GBA-16 is omitted because an election tribunal suspended Attaullah Shah’s membership on 6 November and ordered polling again at three stations on 15 November; no subsequent reinstatement was established. GBA-9’s Akhtar Abbas won a September by-election. The assembly’s official online member directory had not been updated with a 2026 roster, so the member-specific URLs point instead to the election reporting, party roster and compiled assembly roster."
}